{
  "id": "EUVD-2026-109617",
  "enisaUuid": "fad14c87-dbb5-3eff-b29d-0a1f6ab40fdb",
  "description": "A security vulnerability has been detected in GNOME libgsf up to 1.14.60. The impacted element is the function ole_info_read_metabat of the file gsf/gsf-infile-msole.c of the component OLE2 Parser. The manipulation leads to heap-based buffer overflow. The attack can be initiated remotely. The identifier of the patch is a8e25560b74f84c3f86df6ca0ac59195fa5af68a. It is recommended to apply a patch to fix this issue.",
  "datePublished": "Oct 26, 2026, 6:00:16 AM",
